<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Andrew Neff raised the rating on Sun Microsystems Inc to buy from attractive, according to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- also, Goldman Sachs reiterated Sun on its U.S. recommended and U.S. priority lists, according to the office of analyst Laura Conigliaro.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 32-1/2 on Monday.</p>
</text>
